  "termsTitle": "Terms and Privacy Policy",
  "termsUpdated": "Last updated: November 2026",
  "termsS1Title": "1. What Golaghor is",
  "termsS1Body": "Golaghor connects farmers, buyers and transporters directly, so crops are traded at fair prices without middlemen. You sign up with your mobile number and OTP; one account per number.",
  "termsS2Title": "2. Listings and moderation",
  "termsS2Body": "Farmers must give the correct crop, grade, quantity, price and photo. Buyers see a listing only after a moderator approves it. Wrong or misleading listings may be hidden, and repeated cases can lead to suspension.",
  "termsS3Title": "3. Safe payment and fees",
  "termsS3Body": "The buyer's money is held in safe payment. The farmer is paid when the crop is loaded, and the transporter when the delivery OTP is given. Only the buyer pays the 1% platform fee. Quality and quantity are final at loading.",
  "termsS4Title": "4. Cancellation and refunds",
  "termsS4Body": "If you cancel before the truck leaves, 10% of the fare is kept and the rest is refunded. After that, a cancelled load refunds the crop price and fee, not the fare. Report problems in the app; we reply within 24 hours.",
  "termsS5Title": "5. Transport and delivery",
  "termsS5Body": "Transporters must give correct vehicle details and can't mark a delivery done without the buyer's OTP. Buyers should give the OTP only when the truck has arrived.",
  "termsS6Title": "6. Your data",
  "termsS6Body": "We keep your name, mobile number, address, photos, NID number (optional) and trade records only to run the app, verify users and settle disputes. Trade partners see only what they need (name, area, rating). We never sell your data.",
  "termsS7Title": "7. Conduct and ratings",
  "termsS7Body": "Everyone must act honestly and respectfully. Ratings can be given after each trade; fake ratings or harassment can lead to suspension.",
